<section class='founder-story' aria-labelledby='story-heading'>
  <div class='story-wrapper'>
    <div class='story-container'>
      <div class='story-image'>
        <img
          src='/logos-and-images/Business Photo.JPG'
          alt='Jennifer, founder of JMJ Financial Coaching'
          width='400'
          height='400'
          loading='lazy'
        />
      </div>
      <div class='story-right-content'>
        <div class='story-header'>
          <div class='icon-wrapper'>
            <svg
              xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
              width='64'
              height='64'
              viewBox='0 0 24 24'
              fill='none'
              stroke='currentColor'
              stroke-width='2'
              stroke-linecap='round'
              stroke-linejoin='round'
              class='section-icon'
            >
              <path d='M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2'></path>
              <circle cx='12' cy='7' r='4'></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 id='story-heading'>My Story</h2>
        </div>
        <div class='story-text'>
          <p>
            Three years ago, I suddenly lost my job and our household income was cut in half overnight. We were really
            scared. But putting together a budget changed everything. We made some lifestyle changes, and I got to
            achieve our dream of me being a stay at home mom.
          </p>
          <p>
            That experience of fear and then finding peace through taking control of our money is why I became a
            financial coach. I want to help you find that same peace and reach your goals, just like we did.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder-story {
    padding-block: var(--space-16);
    width: 100%;
  }

  .story-wrapper {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: var(--space-6);
  }

  .story-container {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 44, 156, 0.05), rgba(74, 155, 142, 0.05));
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-12);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .story-right-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .story-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }

  .icon-wrapper {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .section-icon {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
  }

  .story-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(var(--font-size-xl), 3vw, var(--font-size-2xl));
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .story-image {
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .story-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .story-text {
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .story-text p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .story-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .story-image {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
